      "message": "Sorry for the late reply, we have customized a gid as \"theme\" on some models, and configured the corresponding permissions in the product partition as follows:\n\u003cpermission name\u003d\"android.permission.READ_PRIVILEGED_PHONE_STATE\"\u003e\n     \u003cgroup gid\u003d\"theme\"/\u003e\n\u003c/permission\u003e\nHowever, the definition of this gid cannot be found on many models, so a -1 is added to READ_PRIVILEGED_PHONE_STATE, causing many system application processes that use this permission to fail to start. The error is reported as follows:\nJNI FatalError called: (com.android.permissioncontroller) frameworks/base/core/jni/com_android_internal_os_Zygote.cpp:598: setgroups failed: Invalid argument, gids.size\u003d4\nSo we hope to add some judgments to enhance robustness when reading gid.",
